OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThursday will start chilly with
OL,6,Fsome local mist or fog patches,
OL,7,Fespecially in rural areas. However, it
OL,8,Fwill be a fine day with plenty of
OL,9,Fsunshine developing, this turning a
OL,10,Flittle hazy at times. Becoming warm in
OL,11,Fthe afternoon too.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying dry through the
OL,14,Fevening and overnight with clear
OL,15,Fspells for a time. However, areas of
OL,16,Flow cloud are likely to form later
OL,17,Falong with some mist and fog patches.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
