OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FAlthough the odd bright
OL,6,Finterval is possible, Friday generally
OL,7,Flooks rather cloudy with some mist and
OL,8,Ffog patches gradually lifting.
OL,9,FOccasional light rain could also
OL,10,Faffect some northwestern areas.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAfter
OL,13,Fa grey, misty start Saturday should be
OL,14,Ffine with some sunshine. The chance of
OL,15,Fsome showers developing on Sunday,
OL,16,Fahead of another fine day on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
